{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t屯門建發里2號一幢工業大廈有外牆的棚網起火，火警已被大致救熄。消防灌救期間，有200人被疏散到安全地方。<br/>\n<br/>\n火警發生在下午約2時。消防派出一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:35:56.528333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:18:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:44:08.087766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:34.709049+00:00","content_hash":"cfb7f1d57a775a49b459d39cf4a1ae0c59e3452396e39a9410ff6635ce3469db","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}